#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
