#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST"
msgid "Yeesh, what happened to you?"
