#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR"
