#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
