msgstr "Wolfgang thích túi bánh mì dai ngon này."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD"
