#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
